    "title": "Digital watch face - SUMO INFO",
    "description": "Artistic digital watch face for WearOS devices\r\n\r\nPhone App Features:\r\nThe phone app only assists with the installation of the watch face, it is not required for the use of the watch face.\r\n\r\nWatch Face Features:\r\n\u2022 Digital Time\r\n\u2022 Step Counter\r\n\u2022 Always ON Display Mode\r\n\r\nCustomization\r\nTouch and hold the watch display than tap on Customize button\r\n\r\nThis watch face supports all Wear OS devices with API-level 30+, such as Samsung Galaxy Watch 4, 5, 6, Pixel Watch, etc.",
